  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 811.23 Health Effects Language",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 811.23 Health Effects Language. If a CWS O/O reports in the CCR an MCL, MRDL, or a treatment technique violation as specified in Env-Dw 700, the CCR shall contain the applicable health effects language for the contaminant as specified in Env-Dw 804 through Env-Dw 810.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Dw 800) #9730, eff 6-30-10 (from Env-Dw 811.21); ss by #12675, eff 1-1-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw800.html"
